ggml Metal: use the simdgroup mul_mm kernel for 32 <= K < 64 at batch > 8 (was K >= 64), and add the
bf16 x bf16 mul_mm kernel. Cherry-picked from llama.cpp f7b41cca4f (#30982), with its test-backend-ops cases
(plus K = 36, the SD conv_in im2col width).

